<title>NEW ZEALAND: Brierley half yr announcement on March 6.</title>
<headline>Brierley half yr announcement on March 6.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brierley Investments Ltd said on Tuesday it would make its half year profit announcement at 8.00 a.m. (1900 GMT) on March 6.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
